message:
feat(migration): add chain migration readiness derivation (#5)

- Add readiness derivation logic from legacy/upgraded account state.
  - Add SDK mock adapter needed by the readiness flow.
  - Introduce only readiness-related migration types now.
- Files:
  - `src/migration/state/buildMigrationReadinessSnapshot.ts`
  - `src/migration/state/mockSdkAdapter.ts`
  - `src/migration/types/migration.ts` (readiness subset first)

---

Tldr: add utils function to convert accountService and
legacyAccountService into an interface to determine if the migration is
needed:
```js
type MigrationReadinessSnapshot = {
  chains: Record<
    number,
    {
      expectedLegacyCommitments: number;
      migratedCommitments: number;
      legacyMasterSeedNullifiedCount: number;
      hasPostMigrationCommitments: boolean;
      isMigrated: boolean;
    }
  >;
  requiresMigration: boolean;
  isFullyMigrated: boolean;
  requiredChainIds: number[];
  migratedChainIds: number[];
  missingChainIds: number[];
  diagnostics: {
    warnings: string[];
    legacyErrors: unknown[];
    upgradedErrors: unknown[];
  };
};
```

